From de9da54622bab66c73a012554467aa089adca4ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Po-Hao Huang <phhuang@realtek.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 14:59:52 +0800
Subject: Revert "wifi: rtw89: fix unable to receive probe responses under MLO connection"
Git-commit: de9da54622bab66c73a012554467aa089adca4ad
Patch-mainline: v7.4-rc1
References: stable-fixes

This reverts commit 6f6d7a325fbde4f025ee1b1277f6f44727e21223.

We no longer require this change after commit 0b0ff976af94
("wifi: mac80211: accept probe response on link address as well")
Previously, the encryption and decryption of MLD connections are not
working properly during scan, this could lead to timeout on some
applications.

Signed-off-by: Po-Hao Huang <phhuang@realtek.com>
Signed-off-by: Ping-Ke Shih <pkshih@realtek.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260909070004.35353-4-pkshih@realtek.com
Acked-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>

---
 drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw89/fw.c |    3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw89/fw.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw89/fw.c
@@ -8074,7 +8074,6 @@ int rtw89_hw_scan_start(struct rtw89_dev
 	struct cfg80211_scan_request *req = &scan_req->req;
 	const struct rtw89_chan *chan = rtw89_chan_get(rtwdev,
 						       rtwvif_link->chanctx_idx);
-	struct ieee80211_vif *vif = rtwvif_link_to_vif(rtwvif_link);
 	struct rtw89_vif *rtwvif = rtwvif_link->rtwvif;
 	struct rtw89_chanctx_pause_parm pause_parm = {
 		.rsn = RTW89_CHANCTX_PAUSE_REASON_HW_SCAN,
@@ -8104,8 +8103,6 @@ int rtw89_hw_scan_start(struct rtw89_dev
 	if (req->flags & NL80211_SCAN_FLAG_RANDOM_ADDR)
 		get_random_mask_addr(mac_addr, req->mac_addr,
 				     req->mac_addr_mask);
-	else if (ieee80211_vif_is_mld(vif))
-		ether_addr_copy(mac_addr, vif->addr);
 	else
 		ether_addr_copy(mac_addr, rtwvif_link->mac_addr);
 
